<title>PHILIPPINES: Jollibee to open 20 overseas stores in '97.</title>
<headline>Jollibee to open 20 overseas stores in '97.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fastfood firm Jollibee Foods Corp said it will set up 20 overseas stores this year and tap new markets in the United States, Papua New Guinea and China.</p>
<p>&quot;We are confident that we can create a global presence by increasing the number of stores in existing markets as well as establishing footholds in new ones,&quot; Jollibee marketing director for international operations Jay Visco said in a statement released late Tuesday.</p>
<p>Jollibee, the leader in the Philippine fastfood sector, at present has a total of 24 overseas stores of which 14 are located in Asia-Pacific and ten in the Middle East.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
